<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was quiet late Friday. There were no sales of slaughter steers or heifers confirmed at the close.</p>
<p>Inquiry and demand were light. Sales confirmed for the week on 67,200 cattle including 14,600 head or about 22 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed: none	last week:  2300     last year: 150</p>
